# Build context: ai-service/. The Dockerfile copies only requirements.txt and
# app/, but these rules keep local state out of the image even if those COPY
# lines change. Otherwise a broader COPY would bake .env secrets into images
# that deploy.yml pushes to a registry.

# Secrets
.env
.env.*

# Host bytecode and tooling state. COPY app/ carried the host's __pycache__
# into the image, so local and CI builds produced different images.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.venv
venv
.pytest_cache

# Not needed at runtime
tests
